abstract: >-
  A Claude skill that classifies AI-assisted decisions into three governance
  zones by reversibility, exposure and frequency: AI-Primary, Collaborative,
  and Human-Primary. It states the governance rule for each zone and the cost
  of misclassifying in either direction. Implements the Augmented Marketing
  Decision Architecture. Skill implementation is MIT licensed; the canonical
  framework text is CC BY-ND 4.0.
